stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ComposerReady
    ComposerReady --> CommandQueued: direct im_send_message
    CommandQueued --> Local: PendingSend status Local
    Local --> SendingPersisted: P1 PersistOk
    SendingPersisted --> SendingFrame: timeline readback

    state SendingFrame {
        [*] --> FrameV2Sending
        FrameV2Sending: schemaVersion 2
        FrameV2Sending: one message.timeline mutation
        FrameV2Sending: timelinePatch replaceView
        FrameV2Sending: MessageVm id is temporaryId
        FrameV2Sending: eventSeq 0
        FrameV2Sending: delivery kind sending
    }

    SendingFrame --> SentPersisted: HTTP SUCCESS
    SendingFrame --> FailedPersisted: HTTP PortError or timeout
    SendingFrame --> SentPersisted: authoritative WS echo
    FailedPersisted --> SentPersisted: late authoritative WS echo
    SentPersisted --> SentFrame: terminal PersistOk and timeline readback
    FailedPersisted --> FailedFrame: terminal PersistOk and timeline readback

    state SentFrame {
        [*] --> FrameV2Sent
        FrameV2Sent: schemaVersion 2
        FrameV2Sent: one message.timeline mutation
        FrameV2Sent: revision increments from sending
        FrameV2Sent: MessageVm id becomes server id
        FrameV2Sent: delivery kind sent
    }

    state FailedFrame {
        [*] --> FrameV2Failed
        FrameV2Failed: one message.timeline mutation
        FrameV2Failed: MessageVm id remains temporaryId
        FrameV2Failed: delivery failed with reason and retryable
    }

    SentFrame --> [*]
    FailedFrame --> [*]

    SentFrame --> WsPostOptional: independent WS delivery
    SendingFrame --> WsPostOptional: WS may race HTTP terminal
    WsPostOptional --> DialogWriteRead: gate apply and attached dialog
    DialogWriteRead --> DialogListFrame: GuardedBump plus Get channel PersistOk

    state DialogListFrame {
        [*] --> DialogMutation
        DialogMutation: message.left-dialog-list always
        DialogMutation: message.unread-summary when contribution changes
        DialogMutation: full replaceView VM
    }

    state DialogLeftIndependent {
        [*] --> DialogQueryOrRecovery
        DialogQueryOrRecovery --> DialogListFrame
    }

    note right of CommandQueued
        AcceptedCommand is not a Frame
        and is not a delivery state.
    end note

    note right of SendingFrame
        Producer-backed G01 fixture:
        sending.frame-v2.json
    end note

    note right of SentFrame
        Producer-backed G01 fixture:
        sent.frame-v2.json
    end note

    note right of DialogLeftIndependent
        Query and recovery can produce the same Surface
        without a G01 send.
    end note

    note right of WsPostOptional
        This may look like the third Frame in a runtime trace.
        It is conditional, may race sent, and belongs to
        the inbound post correlation rather than the direct command replay.
    end note
